Subject: [PATCH 06/21] Add Essence Burn target-bound die-exile support

Gate B analogues: Touch of the Void and Carbonize (damage-spell die-exile riders), Disintegrate (combined regeneration and die-exile riders), and Torch the Tower (runtime target-bound replacement).

